// Rows 3g/3h (BT-4431): compiled with no class state, so a literal send to
// `double:` is a guarded static call. The harness then publishes "declares
// class variables" for it (`beamtalk_class_metadata:put_class_variables/2`,
// the write a reload adding `classState:` makes), so the static call key is
// never installed and every send declines to the class process.
Object subclass: VbLateStateMath

  class double: x :: Integer -> Integer => x * 2
